markdown# System Architecture

## Infrastructure
- **Deployment:** Cloudflare Pages for frontends; Cloudflare Workers for serverless backends.
- **Domain Management:** Managed via Cloudflare (e.g., slotsfreeusa.com, bransonblastusa.com).
- **Version Control:** GitHub repositories connected directly to Cloudflare Pages.

## Data Flow
- **Affiliate Site:** User visits -> Redirects via Workers (to track clicks) -> Landing on Operator site (BetMGM/Caesars).
- **Pet App (Bubbles):** React frontend -> Cloudflare D1/KV storage for pet-needs data.

## External Integrations
- Caesars Palace Online Casino & BetMGM (CPA/RevShare/Hybrid tracking).
- Cloudflare API for automated DNS and certificate management.
 STYLE.md (Coding Standards)
markdown# Coding Standards

## TypeScript & React
- **Standard:** Use TypeScript for all logic; no JavaScript files allowed.
- **Styling:** Use Tailwind CSS utility classes exclusively.
- **State:** Prefer React Hooks (`useState`, `useContext`) over class-based state.

## Naming Conventions
- **Components:** PascalCase (e.g., `AffiliateTracker.tsx`)
- **Functions:** camelCase (e.g., `getAffiliateReport()`)
- **Files:** kebab-case (e.g., `casino-data-fetcher.ts`)

## Best Practices
- Always add meaningful comments to complex affiliate tracking logic.
- Run `npm test` before requesting a commit or deployment.
