git-instructions.md (Workflow Rules)
markdown# Git Workflow

## Commit Message Format
Follow Conventional Commits:
- `feat: [Description]` for new site features (e.g., new casino review page).
- `fix: [Description]` for tracking link or API fixes.
- `docs: [Description]` for MD file updates.

## Branching & Merging
- Main branch is `main`.
- Features should be developed in `feature/branch-name`.
- Always check build status on Cloudflare Pages before merging PRs.


